---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Roadmap | Becoming an FDE">
  <section class="section">
    <p class="kicker">30-Day Roadmap</p>
    <h1>Roadmap</h1>
    <p class="lede">A small launch plan: publish useful pages, collect job postings, prepare application materials, and build one portfolio demo.</p>
    <div class="list">
      <div class="item"><strong>Week 1:</strong> Site skeleton, homepage, first article, collect 10–20 postings.</div>
      <div class="item"><strong>Week 2:</strong> Publish 3–5 articles, add SEO basics, connect domain.</div>
      <div class="item"><strong>Week 3:</strong> Resume rewrite, first applications, choose portfolio project.</div>
      <div class="item"><strong>Week 4:</strong> Deploy first demo and write a case-study style article.</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
